    "updated_at": "2018-01-30T09:42:55Z",
    "body": "If folks try to nest lists inside `p`, it seems the note is better suited there, no?\r\n\r\nI agree that block/inline could use some further thought as I notice it persisting to some extent too. Although I haven't really needed a replacement for \"block\". When do you find yourself using that? Anyway, feel free to raise a new issue to explore it further.\r\n\r\n(W3C HTML might not be the best justification as it's full of newly introduced inconsistencies since https://annevankesteren.nl/2016/01/film-at-11.)",
