    "updated_at": "2018-01-30T13:34:41Z",
    "body": "I think it's useful to have something about it in `p`, but if paragraph itself can be explained better that'd be good too. We could add some more cross-references too, perhaps. Specific suggestions most welcome.\r\n\r\nI guess you're right you might want to have a term for that, though if the specification itself doesn't use it anywhere I wonder how it'll end up getting used.",
