    "updated_at": "2018-01-31T09:48:23Z",
    "body": "Yeah, it seems reasonable to fiddle a bit with that. I suspect that's what \"more general thematic grouping\" is about, but we could just change that to \"structural grouping\" or make a more elaborate change to describe it as several alternatives from a list. I recommend opening new issues for the problems you see though. I think that'll make it easier to address them.",
